Revision history for App-Outcrop

0.01
    - Support Japanese and English UI with a saved browser language preference.
    - Package Outcrop as App::Outcrop with the outcrop web and worker commands.
    - Install web assets and systemd examples alongside the application modules.
    - Support CPAN installation and the existing GitHub/Carton workflow.
    - Isolate dedicated-prefix dependencies from shared Perl libraries.
    - Listen on localhost unless OUTCROP_LISTEN explicitly enables remote access.
